              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "290-1-b",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 7,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "such tax, interest, penalty, fine or any other sum is reduced as a result of an order of the Adjudicating Authority as defined in section 5(1) of the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code, 2016 (31 of 2016), the Assessing Officer shall serve on the assessee a modified notice of demand specifying the sum payable, if any, and such notice shall be treated as a notice under section 289 and the provisions of this Act shall accordingly apply in relation to such notice.",
